  {
    "id": 7006001080010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー。どうだったんだい？\r\n最終審査の結果は……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最終審査には……残念ながら通過できなかった",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001080020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶はここまでよくがんばった\r\nこれは……俺の力不足だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001080030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーのせいじゃないさ\r\nそんなに自分を責めないでほしい",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001080040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』の舞台に立てなかったことは、すごく悔しい\r\nでも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001080050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もう少しで手が届くところまで連れてきてくれた\r\nプロデューサーには感謝してるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、咲耶と一緒にここまで来られたこと\r\n誇りに思っている……",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』には出場できなかったが\r\n咲耶は十分、魅力的なアイドルだよ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001080060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、ありがとう。プロデューサー\r\nこれからも、よろしく頼むよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600108/7006001080060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nこれからも一緒に、頑張っていこうな！",
